{
 "name": "campaign_vae_compile",
 "description": "VAE decode compile (diffusion_speed.py, UNSLOTH_DIFFUSION_COMPILE_VAE=auto|0|1; auto allows AutoencoderKL and denies QwenImage / Wan / MiniMaxH3) at speed_mode default. What moves is the decode, so read new_s and cold_s (compile tax) rather than s/step, which cancels the VAE by construction. Each cell gets its own TORCHINDUCTOR_CACHE_DIR / TRITON_CACHE_DIR: fresh on the FIRST run only, so delete $WORKSPACE/temp/diffusion_bench/inductor/<tag> (or --set a new env path) before re-measuring cold. Wan cells force the denied path (vae1) to re-check the deny decision. Needs a Studio tree that has COMPILE_VAE (feature worktrees such as wt_refresh_speed; not in unsloth main at 168961def, 2026-09-23, where the env var is ignored and vae0 / vae1 / auto are the same cell).",
